<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Hata - Sigara Takip Sitesi</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .error-container {
            margin-top: 50px;
            padding: 30px;
            border: 2px solid #e53935;
            background-color: #ffebee;
        }
        .error-container h2 {
            color: #c62828;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .error-detail {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            color: #333;
            font-family: monospace;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="profile-menu-wrapper">
        <button id="profileIconButton" class="profile-icon-button" type="button" title="Kayıtlı Profiller">
            👤
        </button>
        <div id="profileDropdown" class="profile-dropdown hidden">
            <div class="profile-dropdown-title">Kayıtlı Profiller</div>
            <div id="profileDropdownList"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container error-container">
        <h2><%= message %></h2>
        <p>Bir sorunla karşılaştık. Lütfen tekrar deneyin veya yönergeleri izleyin.</p>
        
        <% if (locals.detail) { %>
            <div class="error-detail">
                <%= detail %>
            </div>
        <% } %>

        <div class="actions">
            <a href="/" class="home-btn">Ana Sayfaya Dön</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="/public/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
